{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.poster.avif?t=1758142956\" width=662 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.webm?t=1758142956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.mp4?t=1758142956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Negative Space</i> is a <strong>deckbuilder</strong> without traditional combat. Instead, you\u2019ll build a synergistic crew to maximize their effort output, navigate uncharted planets, weather unpredictable crises, and capitalize on timely boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/ca5f7ac97021fe7cc02daa8f044a395e.poster.avif?t=1758142956\" width=660 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/ca5f7ac97021fe7cc02daa8f044a395e.webm?t=1758142956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/ca5f7ac97021fe7cc02daa8f044a395e.mp4?t=1758142956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble Your Crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey through the galaxy, you\u2019ll encounter a plethora of crewmembers\u2014each with a unique ability to add to your deck. By combining their effects with your chosen Captain, you'll need to explore distant planets and collect enough stars to complete your mission before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/d4df19621495fcde83051798885f507b.avif?t=1758142956\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras_big/d4df19621495fcde83051798885f507b.avif?t=1758142956 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Power of Trinkets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete difficult missions and you\u2019ll earn powerful trinkets that shape your strategy and evolve your playstyle. Their benefits may not be obvious at first glance, so you'll need to experiment. Unexpected combinations can propel your deck into the next universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/828f2d0092cbe38dde5de31c644c0dd0.poster.avif?t=1758142956\" width=660 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/828f2d0092cbe38dde5de31c644c0dd0.webm?t=1758142956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/828f2d0092cbe38dde5de31c644c0dd0.mp4?t=1758142956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 crew cards and 50 game-changing trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Captains with unique abilities and signature trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability\u2014no two runs are ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-crafted, colorful galaxy to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delightful and surprising chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical gameplay where every decision matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock higher difficulty with an Ascension system after victory</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624300?t=1758142956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/381fa81e8c6a26f2da5a7f81f767ce8d907ec2c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758142956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/08be923a2a6d2292b44ca28debc0c9426fae5fd2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758142956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/08be923a2a6d2292b44ca28debc0c9426fae5fd2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758142956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3746770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.poster.avif?t=1758142956\" width=662 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.webm?t=1758142956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.mp4?t=1758142956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Negative Space</i> is a <strong>deckbuilder</strong> without traditional combat. Instead, you\u2019ll build a synergistic crew to maximize their effort output, navigate uncharted planets, weather unpredictable crises, and capitalize on timely boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopl